  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "For some ETH members, spending time in their home office is a good opportunity for further training. For this purpose, our subject specialists have made a wide selection of options for you:\n\nOverview of freely accessible e-resources\n\n#KnowMore – The prepared content issued by ETH Library is at your free disposal and gives you a head start.\n\n#ETHLibraryDigital – ETH Library is there for you digitally with various offers and services , not only during the COVID-19 protective measures."
